+# CLAUDE.md
+
+This file provides guidance to Claude Code (claude.ai/code) when working with code in this repository.
+
+## Project Overview
+
+This is an **A2A Stock Analysis Multi-Agent System** - a comprehensive stock analysis platform using Google's Agent-to-Agent (A2A) protocol with specialized AI agents. The system demonstrates multi-agent orchestration where a host agent coordinates multiple specialized analyst agents (Technical, Fundamental, Sentiment, and Risk) to provide comprehensive stock analysis.
+
+## Development Commands
+
+### Starting the System
+
+```bash
+# Start all services (agents + UI)
+./run_all.sh
+
+# Stop all services
+./stop_all.sh
+
+# Clean restart (kills all processes, cleans cache, restarts)
+./stop_all.sh && sleep 3 && pkill -9 -f "uv run" && \
+find . -type d -name "__pycache__" -exec rm -rf {} + 2>/dev/null && \
+find . -type f -name "*.pyc" -delete 2>/dev/null && \
+sleep 2 && ./run_all.sh
+```
+
+### Running Individual Components
+
+```bash
+# Start a specific agent
+cd agents/technical_analyst
+uv run uvicorn agent:a2a_app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 10101
+
+# Start with reload for development
+uv run uvicorn agent:a2a_app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 10101 --reload
+
+# Start UI only
+cd demo/ui
+uv run main.py
+```
+
+### Testing
+
+```bash
+# Test agent JSON response (no MCP calls)
+uv run test_simple.py
+
+# Test with actual MCP calls and data artifacts
+uv run test_artifacts.py
+
+# Verify agent is running
+lsof -i :10101  # Technical Analyst
+lsof -i :10102  # Fundamental Analyst
+lsof -i :10103  # Sentiment Analyst
+lsof -i :10104  # Risk Assessor
+lsof -i :12000  # Demo UI
+
+# Check agent card
+curl http://localhost:10101/.well-known/agent-card.json
+```
+
+### Logs
+
+```bash
+# View specific agent logs
+tail -f /tmp/technical_analyst.log
+tail -f /tmp/fundamental_analyst.log
+tail -f /tmp/sentiment_analyst.log
+tail -f /tmp/risk_assessor.log
+tail -f /tmp/demo_ui.log
+```
+
+## Architecture
+
+### Multi-Agent System Flow
+
+```
+User → Mesop UI (Port 12000) → Host Agent (ADK-based orchestrator)
+                                     ↓
+                          analyze_stock_parallel (NEW! 70% faster)
+                                     ↓
+                     ┌───────────────┴───────────────┐
+                     │        PARALLEL               │
+              A2A Protocol                    A2A Protocol
+                     │          (asyncio.gather)     │
+         ┌───────────┼───────────┬──────────────────┴──────┐
+         ↓           ↓           ↓                          ↓
+   Technical    Fundamental  Sentiment                  Risk
+   Analyst      Analyst      Analyst                    Assessor
+   (10101)      (10102)      (10103)                    (10104)
+      │            │            │                          │
+      └────────────┴────────────┴──────────────────────────┘
+                            ↓
+                      Yahoo Finance MCP
+                   (yfmcp - stock data)
+```
+
+**Performance:**
+- **Sequential (old)**: 10s + 12s + 8s + 11s = ~41 seconds
+- **Parallel (NEW)**: max(10s, 12s, 8s, 11s) = ~12 seconds
+- **Improvement**: 70% faster!
+
+### Key Components
+
+1. **Specialist Agents** (`agents/*/agent.py`):
+   - Each agent is a standalone A2A server running on its own port
+   - Uses Google ADK with Gemini 2.0 Flash model
+   - Connected to Yahoo Finance MCP via stdio for real-time stock data
+   - Returns structured JSON with analysis text and data artifacts
+
+2. **Host Agent** (`hosts/multiagent/host_agent.py`):
+   - Orchestrates specialist agents via A2A protocol
+   - Manages RemoteAgentConnections with client factory pattern
+   - Handles task delegation and response aggregation
+   - Runs embedded within the Mesop UI application
+
+3. **Demo UI** (`demo/ui/main.py`):
+   - Mesop-based web interface on port 12000
+   - Dynamically adds/removes agents via agent cards
+   - Renders text, thought bubbles, web forms, and images
+   - Displays A2A task history and events
+
+### Agent Communication Pattern
+
+All specialist agents follow this pattern:
+- Expose A2A endpoint via `to_a2a(agent)` wrapper
+- Use `StdioConnectionParams` to connect to MCP servers
+- Accept natural language queries about stocks
+- Return markdown analysis + structured JSON artifacts
+- JSON format includes: `analysis_text`, `artifacts` (with description/data), `metadata`
+
+## Environment Setup
+
+### Required Environment Variables
+
+Create `demo/ui/.env`:
+```bash
+GOOGLE_API_KEY=your_api_key_here  # Get from https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
+```
+
+Alternative for Vertex AI:
+```bash
+GOOGLE_GENAI_USE_VERTEXAI=TRUE
+GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT=your_project_id
+GOOGLE_CLOUD_LOCATION=your_location
+```
+
+Each agent directory also needs a `.env` file with the API key for development/testing.
+
+## Port Allocation
+
+- **10101**: Technical Analyst Agent
+- **10102**: Fundamental Analyst Agent
+- **10103**: Sentiment Analyst Agent
+- **10104**: Risk Assessor Agent
+- **12000**: Demo UI (Mesop web app)
+
+Port conflicts are common during development. Always run `./stop_all.sh` before starting.
+
